      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: this solves one issue in regards to the scaling and particles but not completely because while setting the scaling mode from local to hierarchy should fix some issues, other issues such as physics (gravity, limit velocity, noise, etc.) do not scale with your model. It may be worth revisiting this issue as many do not have the luxury of going back and using the scale factor parameter to fix their particle's physics.",
